{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30006_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0f8f542a29785f2bf6bee26c38c7e6c3926379fb1a85e8bc32146b33d5c59c80",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3b89273bfc6da3111ba60c1d4e6f96a037c40ffb49524edacc97b1e0967ba33",
      "text": "哎，有点问题。因为个子太高，拍出来的效果\n似乎不如预想的那么好。虽然我也调整过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2def8d4f4c1b2f7a6d69fb78f1bca82885c7363113ec3f7761ea7d882d56f24",
      "text": "像个头较矮的苍井弟弟，都被截出画面了。\n算了……让你直接看一眼更快吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15d6bb36f6db21e97c026f9d0a490fc7008fa9cd0d8d013c8860409856769d08",
      "text": "让我看看……\n啊，真的耶！我只露出了个脑袋！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27b22ace0fd415174ca9475df09fb1840bfcce58e2ef3dd3e301245cdc77ddc3",
      "text": "这样可不行啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:788054ab0fb3a739d00b8e11422b9aed780f3c0c3d6983adae312129293f22fb",
      "text": "我可能不太适合当摄影师。\n找人替一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1960a19776c851e4bf8d45c8016cb647cd4f43885d9ebcdc80a5d8843a849493",
      "text": "那就由我来负责掌镜吧。\n毕竟粉丝们也一定想看到所有人的脸庞。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:771a5144fa8caf467c190d76595538fb753e54eac56ec9625d9e7386a55937b2",
      "text": "也是。\n拜托你啦，这位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000090:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a91143ac681e6ffc389e7719ebbf31fba89060631b0918657d121456761381ef",
      "text": "呼……稍微休息一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a00b19cefde85e017e791782e13aa30565bb6a9950e7348761f38a9888a38c31",
      "text": "这次的新歌，北斗君觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0106829adf7a94ecbdeafa0243c5fdd944f7efff1c5ece1df40359475b0b29d4",
      "text": "很时髦很棒呢。\n想早点在演出中展现给大家看呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4120483361af960acaa3cfdfcc2a14d54247fb8cd9b51efa3c2c668f379e2730",
      "text": "对表演水准的要求也很高。\n必须通过反复练习达到完美才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0ec33789eaf074d4eedac9b35cb3ef5b42920968a424b808e5bcaa09a98bd98",
      "text": "说的也是呢。\n也是为了让天使酱们感到高兴☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30006_01:1_3_30006_01_d:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4114609bfbda665a2d75c2944f860d0e0e17087c1ef4ce92412b0930524fc2a",
      "text": "那么接下来我们还要去多加练\n一会儿哦！先拜拜～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
